  "_product_rules": "Past meetings = labeled example only, never an alert. Free: one city + one optional street on that city, upcoming only. Paid: $5/month per extra city (Stripe test, subscription quantity), street included with each city, never charged per street; allowed cities = 1 + paid extra cities, capped at the ten supported cities. A street matches only in its own city's agendas. Ignore multi-email signups for now.",
  "_cities_note": "Supported cities: state -> metro -> city (stable city key). Seventeen, all Utah (Daniel = Town of Daniel, Wasatch County, PMN entity 898; Park City = PMN entity 233, Summit County, in the Heber micropolitan area since OMB 2023; St. George = PMN entity 277, Washington County, St. George metro). PMN entity = government type 3 (Municipality); public_bodies are exact PMN body names. The per-user plan cap stays at 10 cities (aw_cities.MAX_CITIES)."
